/// [seed_data.dart] (which stays untouched and readable).
///
/// Every row is static and deterministic — no RNG, identical on every launch.
/// Ids are namespaced `th-<account>-<n>` so they never collide with the
/// fixture ids (`t-*`) or the runtime counter (`t1000+`).
///
/// Placement zones (relative to the pinned today, 9 Aug 2026):
///   A · 1 Sep 2025 – 31 May 2026  — the bulk of the volume.
///   B · 1 Jun – 31 Jul 2026       — sparse; NO groceries / drill-down keys,
///        so the "last 3 months" Same-transactions fixtures keep their counts.
///   (No rows on 1–7 Aug — those documented day-net fixtures stay bit-identical.
///    The 8–9 Aug "Zone D" rows are marked inline in the a-amex / a-bonus blocks.)
///
/// Each account's Zone A/B additions are compensated by an adjusted
/// `startingBalance` in [seed_data.dart], so every balance as of 1 Aug 2026 —
/// and thus every documented August figure — is unchanged. The 8–9 Aug rows
